      "instance_name": "man",
      "label": "a middle-aged to older man",
      "description": "A man with gray hair, wearing a dark suit, white shirt, and patterned tie, standing with arms outstretched in a gesture of emphasis or appeal. He appears to be speaking or presenting, with a microphone clipped to his tie. His facial expression is earnest and engaged, suggesting he is conveying an important message. He is the central visual focus of the image.",
